job-name-club-manager = Club Manager
job-description-club-manager = Run the club aboard the ship. Provide drinks, food, and entertainment — and keep the workers paid.

job-name-club-worker = Club Worker
job-description-club-worker = Cook, clean, serve, tend the bar, entertain, or bounce. You work for the Club Manager.

job-name-club-artist = Club Artist
job-description-club-artist = Create works of art for the club to display or sell. Loyal to your craft — and to the Manager who houses you.

job-name-vagabond = Vagabond
job-description-vagabond = A stowaway journeying on the ship. No wage, no schedule — find paying work, stay out of trouble, and survive.

job-supervisors-club-manager = the Club Manager

department-Club = Club
department-Club-description = Civilian service aboard the ship — the bar, kitchen, stage, and the freeloaders who live in the maintenance tunnels.

